  abilityId: 2840608
  abilityName: Graceful Fate
  abilityDesc: 20 combo massive Thunder attack on all foes, hugely boosts damage
    dealt against status afflicted foes for 3 turns, enormously boosts Thunder elemental
    damage for 3 turns, activates BB/SBB/UBB twice for 1 turn, enormously boosts
    Spark damage for 3 turns & adds random status ailment infliction to attack for
    3 turns
